i": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824611_1476752346656146_76211345958897926_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_NSd1lkYqXoQ7kNvwGmz1cJ&_nc_oc=AdqIIgUJCzPUPVgGkaSXXbsNpTUO5nNpP7ZSu4vC2HlbFhyH6u0sUK2wGbR5J5PswTU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDXguVPB2FrDgvNO9nYc7_dAI5VTQ0mXyvGtH070pr6Cw&oe=6A5B7582"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1258637619606809", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830888_1258637626273475_6860298828059780677_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JcU9V0AXlDMQ7kNvwElYI_f&_nc_oc=Adpd0t5566R5mQt3WTdeLkFK2Qd8M-a1s5pMkTr41Lx9ljgtl_Te_cuRWq__oZM6o_E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAsZ5xWMWP7xFJ8MN1ba_qA2KsiKK39LwuuDz_GY3H0dA&oe=6A5B6CF5"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1695466365176148", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295661_1695466368509481_3647112861049359753_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YGsUNwWVDUkQ7kNvwHdVxXa&_nc_oc=AdqGLW_NMQvzQXMvPVgxOyH_6w4JaSgwNaIltW862QTKOu0vjP0hmZs3vnA1UW-M8BM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAW-Uk9x9EXI9WON2-4ekLnkBavo0VnF3Ae9kSYGMH4Qg&oe=6A5B8118"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "740173438591786", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_740173441925119_8619547129459863184_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y1vFjJZPSnIQ7kNvwEStchc&_nc_oc=Adrcdjym4vcmNvNB6FX1PQWG6efKM2pXQONtF1bzcy-NKbOrRZNAEDwfSuFDAqADj1s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDxlwlhQ3ni6f9yzDg2k7jUnAgeDtVsh0BK4ZdcKgAPdg&oe=6A5B8295"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car Parking VR - Learn To Park", "keywords": ["parking", "park", "car", "simulator", "stunt"], "long_description": "Car Parking VR \u2013 Learn to Park is the ultimate VR car parking simulator for Meta Quest. Experience realistic car driving, reverse parking, garage parking, and multi-level parking in this advanced virtual reality driving simulator. Learn to drive and park like a pro using smooth steering wheel controls, accurate car physics, and lifelike vehicle handling.\n\nThis VR game features:\n -Real car parking simulator with 3D environments\n -Parallel parking, tight parking spots, angle parking\n -City driving simulator with hard parking levels\n -Driving school mode and car driving test simulator\n -Full car control, and precision driving\n\nPerfect for beginners and pros, this VR parking game teaches timing, accuracy, and skill. Take on extreme parking challenges, train in driving test scenarios, and unlock different vehicles. If you enjoy realistic car games, driving simulators, and car control training, this is your next VR obsession.\nMultiplayer mode coming soon for online driving fun.\nBuilt for Quest, it's the most complete VR car parking game. Get ready to become the ultimate parking master in VR!", "short_description": "Car Parking VR \u2013 Learn to Park is a real car parking simulator with driving school, reverse parking, and extreme parking challenges. Master your car control with realistic physics, steering wheel handling, and precision parking levels. Drive through multi-level parking, tight garages, and city environments. Perfect for fans of VR parking driving games, vehicle simulation, and car driving test experiences. Built for Meta Quest, this is the ultimate virtual reality parking game!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rebels Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_sub